<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάτη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>silver fir, Abies cephalonica</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψηλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.560
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιμήκετος</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κετος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				14.287
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανομήκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.239
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.9.6
			</span></i>, etc.; also, <i>Abies pectinata</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.8.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>oar</i>, as <i>made of pine-wood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεύκαινον ὕδωρ ξεστῇς ἐλάτῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.172
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.5
			</span></i>; later, <i>ship</i> or <i>boat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				208
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alc.</u>
				444
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>the spathe of the date inflorescence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.109.4
			</span></i> (but, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόρασσος</span>
			 (q.v.), ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.151
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>sea-weed</i> supposed to resemble the fir, <i>Cystoseira
				Abies-marina</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.6.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
